        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable character portraits and names</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable equipment names</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 16x speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters can carry up to 9 magic treasures and 9 cultivation techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Gameplay: The game uses an idle combat mode. Players organize a 3x3 formation of heroes for automatic combat (level progression/looping) to advance through stages, and can challenge special dungeons such as the Tower of Heaven and Ancient Secret Realm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivation and Progression: Heroes possess spiritual roots (from common to divine) and levels, which can be upgraded by consuming spirit stones (e.g., Qi Refining, Foundation Establishment). Using a large number of elixirs allows heroes to improve their spiritual roots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth Equipment System: Characters can wear equipment in multiple slots (weapons, armor, rings, etc.), skill books, pets, mounts, and magic treasures. Equipment has quality, level, and random attributes (e.g., Bloodthirst, Divine Speed). High-quality equipment (Immortal grade and above) can have multiple attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources and Systems: Players obtain resources through combat, logging (to obtain spirit stones), and spiritual fields (to cultivate spiritual herbs). Spiritual herbs are used to refine elixirs to create more potent medicines. Other systems include Heavenly Dao Enlightenment (to obtain star souls) and the Mysterious Island (to obtain mounts).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reincarnation System: A reincarnation system allows players to reset their progress to obtain reincarnation points, which can be used to purchase permanent starting bonuses, such as high-quality characters or starting spirit stone reserves.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable character portraits and names</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable equipment names</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 16x speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters can carry up to 9 magic treasures and 9 cultivation techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Gameplay: The game uses an idle combat mode. Players organize a 3x3 formation of heroes for automatic combat (level progression/looping) to advance through stages, and can challenge special dungeons such as the Tower of Heaven and Ancient Secret Realm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivation and Progression: Heroes possess spiritual roots (from common to divine) and levels, which can be upgraded by consuming spirit stones (e.g., Qi Refining, Foundation Establishment). Using a large number of elixirs allows heroes to improve their spiritual roots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth Equipment System: Characters can wear equipment in multiple slots (weapons, armor, rings, etc.), skill books, pets, mounts, and magic treasures. Equipment has quality, level, and random attributes (e.g., Bloodthirst, Divine Speed). High-quality equipment (Immortal grade and above) can have multiple attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources and Systems: Players obtain resources through combat, logging (to obtain spirit stones), and spiritual fields (to cultivate spiritual herbs). Spiritual herbs are used to refine elixirs to create more potent medicines. Other systems include Heavenly Dao Enlightenment (to obtain star souls) and the Mysterious Island (to obtain mounts).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reincarnation System: A reincarnation system allows players to reset their progress to obtain reincarnation points, which can be used to purchase permanent starting bonuses, such as high-quality characters or starting spirit stone reserves.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Up to 16x speed! An idle RPG game with customizable character portraits and names!",
